---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { strings } from '../../i18n/strings';
const t = strings.en;
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title={`Terms of Service | ${t.brand}`} description="Terms of Service for nevnap.app and NévnapTárX." altLangPath="/terms">
  <article class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl pt-3 lg:pt-10">
    <nav class="nx-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <ol><li><a href="/en/">{t.brand}</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">›</li><li aria-current="page">Terms of Service</li></ol>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="mt-6 nx-page-title nx-page-title--sm nx-rise">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-nx-subtle">Last updated: July 18, 2026.</p>

    <section class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-nx-muted leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">1. Service</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">The nevnap.app website and NévnapTárX mobile app ("Service") is a free information service about Hungarian namedays, name meanings and related content. Provided by Renátó Bogár ("Operator").</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">2. Acceptance</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">By using the Service you accept these terms. If you disagree, please do not use the Service.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">3. Permitted use</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Personal, non-commercial use. Prohibited:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
          <li>Copying or republishing content without permission</li>
          <li>Automated scraping, bot activity</li>
          <li>Disrupting Service operation</li>
          <li>Collecting other users' data</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">4. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">NévnapTárX's original source code, design, branding and editorial articles are protected by copyright. Rights in cited third-party materials remain with their respective owners; the Operator does not claim exclusive rights in calendar facts or other bare factual data.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">5. Content accuracy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">The nameday calendar and short name meanings are informational compilations. Calendars may differ, and source-by-source review of meanings is ongoing. Coverage and limitations are documented on the Hungarian <a href="/adatbazis" class="text-nx-accent underline">database and methodology</a> page. The Operator <strong>does not guarantee</strong> full accuracy.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">6. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">The Service is provided "as is". The Operator is not liable for:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
          <li>Service downtime</li>
          <li>Notification delays or failures</li>
          <li>Content inaccuracies</li>
          <li>Third-party service (Cloudflare, Google) issues</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">7. Third-party links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">The Service may contain external links (App Store, Google Play, Ko-fi, future partner pages). We are not responsible for those sites.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">8. Privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">See our <a href="/en/privacy" class="text-nx-accent underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">9. Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Terms may be updated. Significant changes announced on the site. Continued use means acceptance.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">10. Governing law</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Hungarian law applies. Hungarian courts have jurisdiction.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">11. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2"><a href="mailto:bogarrenato@gmail.com" class="text-nx-accent underline">bogarrenato@gmail.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
